<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria Jan-Apr retail sales fall 44 pct real y/y.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria Jan-Apr retail sales fall 44 pct real y/y.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgarian retail sales in the first four months of 1997 were a real 44 percent lower than a year earlier due to soaring year on year inflation, the National Statistics Institute (NSI) said on Thursday.</p>
</text>
